<title>UK: Appleyard been approached,in takeover talks.</title>
<headline>Appleyard been approached,in takeover talks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British automobile distributor Appleyard Group Plc said on Thursday it was in the early stage of talks that might lead to an offer for the company.</p>
</text>
